    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Y</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number to track the sequence of nodes and ed=
ges in an order and to simplify order updates.<br>
      The variable sequenceId runs across all nodes and edges of the same o=
rder and is reset when a new orderId is issued.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><em>edgeDescription</em></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Y</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Additional information on the edge.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">released</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">boolean</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Y</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">"true" indicates that the edge is part of th=
e base.<br>
      "false" indicates that the edge is part of the horizon.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">startNodeId</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Y</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">nodeId of first node within the order.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">endNodeId</td>
