    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">waitForTrigger fails, if order has been canc=
eled.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">cancelOrder</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AGV is stopping or driving, until it reaches=
 the next node.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">AGV stands still and has canceled the order.=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">factsheetRequest</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">The factsheet has been communicated</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
