<h2 id=3D"VDA5050=EC=82=AC=EC=96=91=EC=84=9C-Topic-instantAction">Topic - i=
nstantAction</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <thead class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Object structure</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Data type</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">headerId</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">uint32</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Header ID of the message.<br>
      The header ID is defined per topic and incremented by 1 with each sen=
t (but not necessarily received) message.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">timestamp</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">string</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Timestamp (ISO 8601, UTC); YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:=
ss.ffZ (e.g., "2017-04-15T11:40:03.12Z")</td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
